    {"id":"a03","title":"Attention：一次信息路由的完整推导","slug":"attention-routing","summary":"用查询、键和值拆解注意力的计算与直觉。","publishedAt":"2022-06-21","readingTimeMinutes":14,"sourceUrl":"https://example.com/context-lab/attention-routing"},
